# Cloudflare Pages / Workers (and Netlify): the Simmer demo is a separate
# single-page app, so its recipe pages (e.g. /simmer-demo/recipes/3) have to
# load the demo's index.html. /simmer-demo/ itself is served as a folder
# index, no rule needed. Only the app's route is matched, never /assets/,
# because Cloudflare applies these rules even when a real file exists.
# Add a line here if Simmer gets new routes.
/simmer-demo/recipes/*  /simmer-demo/index.html  200
